//==
// # Arena cases for the sampler agreement laws (complexity sweep, chunk V1)

// A model whose geometry arena the agreement laws of
// checking-samplers.laws.plato check the hoisted samplers and checks on,
// named for the report. Its witnesses are the curved witnesses, the unit box
// with a pcurve, the catalog arena (every curve and surface case) on the
// unit box's topology, and an arena that is not well formed.
// Removes: agreement laws run on every BrepModel witness, or on none of the
// arenas that reach the sampler's other branch.
type ArenaCase
{
    Name: String;
    Model: BrepModel;
}
